OL,3,AJudge denies motion to dismiss Lindsay
OL,4,AClancy's murder case
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Massachusetts judge has denied a
OL,7,Fmotion to dismiss the murder case
OL,8,Fagainst Lindsay Clancy, the US woman
OL,9,Faccused of murdering her three
OL,10,Fchildren.
OL,12,FThe judge's ruling follows her defence
OL,13,Fteam's request to dismiss the case
OL,14,Fafter the 12-person jury in her
OL,15,FSeptember trial failed to reach a
OL,16,Fveridict.
OL,18,FThe ruling clears the way for
OL,19,Fprosecutors to pursue the case. They
OL,20,Fcould reduce the charges in a potential
OL,21,Fsecond trial or dismiss them
OL,22,Faltogether.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
